I reached out a couple of weeks ago about Gong's starter plan for teams under 25 reps. Following up in case it got buried.

Since then we published our Q3 State of Revenue report, based on 3.2 million recorded sales calls. Two findings for a founder-led sales team:

- Deals where the buyer mentions a competitor by name in the first call close 37% less often unless there's a second call within 7 days
- Deals with no next step booked at the end of a call are 4x more likely to slip a quarter

Gong surfaces both automatically, per deal, so the forecast you walk into a board meeting with is one you can defend.

